{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 1369,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dear citizens of the universe,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1574,
    "dDurationMs": 2853,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm super excited to announce that \nin addition to Minute Physics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4484,
    "dDurationMs": 2448,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can also gathered a team\nto bring you, Minute Earth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7032,
    "dDurationMs": 3765,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A new YouTube channel with videos about\nthe Earth and Earth sciences."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10876,
    "dDurationMs": 4631,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is, an anthology of geology, biology,\necology and anthropology. And more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15728,
    "dDurationMs": 2914,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So far, we've covered topics such as,\n\"Why are leaves green?\","
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18718,
    "dDurationMs": 3282,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"How tall can mountains be?\", and, \n\"How much would you hair grow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22068,
    "dDurationMs": 1232,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in three billion years?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23386,
    "dDurationMs": 2429,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Earth's an exciting place with\nlots of awesome science,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25998,
    "dDurationMs": 1535,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so head over to Minute Earth and\ncheck it out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27699,
    "dDurationMs": 3014,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We also have both Minute Physics\nand Minute Earth in Espanol"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30781,
    "dDurationMs": 2963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thanks to the excellent Ever Salazar. "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36453,
    "dDurationMs": 1364,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And last but not certainly not least, "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37936,
    "dDurationMs": 3804,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's a new pop physics book out by \nLee Smolin, called \"Time Reborn\"."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41865,
    "dDurationMs": 3186,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's about our lack of understanding\nof the fundamental nature of time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45290,
    "dDurationMs": 2926,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and why that's crutial in truly explaining\nthe Big Bang and Quantum Mechanics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48333,
    "dDurationMs": 1663,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the long term future of the \nuniverse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50044,
    "dDurationMs": 3292,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Lee was my advisor in grad school and when he \nasked me to do the illustrations for his book,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53532,
    "dDurationMs": 1731,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I said, \"of course!\"."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55332,
    "dDurationMs": 3451,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's definitely one of the most mind opening\nbooks I've read in the last year"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58832,
    "dDurationMs": 2151,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and if you want to learn more about \nthe book, or where to find it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61032,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "click this annotation or the link in\nthe video description."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63932,
    "dDurationMs": 2564,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or head to your favourite bookstore."
    } ]
  } ]
}
